      "writtenOn": "2025-03-10T18:39:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know if it\u0027s the only occurence of this issue. It was reported recently in our Arch Linux bug tracker. It only seems to occur in print preview, and now I\u0027m a bit curious what it was trying to print. :)",
      "parentUuid": "a30b98f1_13a180f1",
      "revId": "8aa11efe05a0c24228068f99ad66ff63c9a167f5",
